JUST IN: 🇧🇷 Flávio Bolsonaro officially rejects results of presidential election against Lula da Silva.

"It is impossible to recognize the election results… we will use our legal team, we will request the annulment of these elections."

@BRICSNews

JUST IN: 🇧🇷 Alex Soros congratulates Lula da Silva following his presidential election victory over Flávio Bolsonaro.

"Lula Lula Lula! Congrats to Brazil for standing up against authoritarianism once again!"

